      "message": "\u003e This was the code in Android15, but I thought, we can avoid nested ifs, but no strong opionion.\n\nSince this isn\u0027t a cherry-pick from android15 (different Change-ID), I think you can tidy stuff up.\n\n\u003e every failure before the STE is enabled won\u0027t have any valid enteries, and if the enablement fail, it\u0027s fatal.\n\nIs that also true for PASID domains?",
